usage: run.py [-h] --gpus GPUS [GPUS ...] --output OUTPUT
              [--source-root SOURCE_ROOT] [--config CONFIG] [--python PYTHON]
              [--dry-run] [--smoke] [--platform {cuda,cpu}] [--job JOB]
              [--manifolds MANIFOLDS [MANIFOLDS ...]]
              [--methods {ours,rcpm} [{ours,rcpm} ...]]
              [--landmarks {fps,random} [{fps,random} ...]]
              [--seeds SEEDS [SEEDS ...]]
              {tables,liegroups,sweep,highd,ablations}

Declare and run paper experiments: python -m paper.run SUITE --gpus 0 --output
runs/NAME.

positional arguments:
  {tables,liegroups,sweep,highd,ablations}

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --gpus GPUS [GPUS ...]
  --output OUTPUT       A fresh run directory
  --source-root SOURCE_ROOT
  --config CONFIG
  --python PYTHON
  --dry-run
  --smoke               Two training updates and one 8-point evaluation; not
                        paper reproduction
  --platform {cuda,cpu}
  --job JOB             Select one exact declared job ID
  --manifolds MANIFOLDS [MANIFOLDS ...]
  --methods {ours,rcpm} [{ours,rcpm} ...]
  --landmarks {fps,random} [{fps,random} ...]
  --seeds SEEDS [SEEDS ...]
